	(text "VLED is switched LED_VSYS. GND is common. Do not bridge LED_VSYS to J1 VSYS copper.\nBrightness/current cap is mandatory; raw VSYS operation is not qualified over battery range.\nBuffer VIH and LED minimum voltage require bench qualification before release."
